genetics-conflicting-mutations = Genetic change rejected: these mutations are incompatible. Disable the conflicting gene first.

genetics-gene-growing-claws = Growing claws
genetics-gene-growing-claws-desc = Claws grow over time and strengthen unarmed attacks. Large claws hinder weapon handling. Disabling the gene preserves growth progress and declawing.
genetics-feeling-growing-claws = You feel pressure at your fingertips.

genetics-gene-cold-dependence = Cold dependence
genetics-gene-cold-dependence-desc = Cold damage begins 25 K earlier and temperature cold damage is multiplied by 1.5. Cooling slows you down, causes drunkenness below 295 K and drowsiness below 285 K.
genetics-feeling-cold-dependence = Cool air makes you feel drowsy.

genetics-gene-thermophilic = Thermophilia
genetics-gene-thermophilic-desc = Raises the overheating threshold by 75 K. At a body temperature of at least 322 K, movement is 10% faster and physical and burn damage gradually heals.
genetics-feeling-thermophilic = Warmth fills your body with energy.

genetics-gene-ore-sense = Ore sense
genetics-gene-ore-sense-desc = Periodically detects ore deposits within 5 meters.
genetics-feeling-ore-sense = You sense a faint response from nearby minerals.

genetics-gene-cold-tolerance = Cold tolerance
genetics-gene-cold-tolerance-desc = Lowers the cold damage threshold by 30 K, halves temperature cold damage and reduces other cold damage by 30%. Cold-induced slowdown begins later.
genetics-feeling-cold-tolerance = Cool air no longer feels so unpleasant.

genetics-gene-flammable = Flammable covering
genetics-gene-flammable-desc = Triples burning damage and increases other heat damage by 15%. Lowers the overheating threshold by 5 K and doubles temperature heat damage.
genetics-feeling-flammable = Your skin becomes more sensitive to heat.

genetics-gene-wooden-armor = Woody covering
genetics-gene-wooden-armor-desc = Reduces blunt damage by 30%, slash damage by 20% and piercing damage by 10%.
genetics-feeling-wooden-armor = Your skin hardens like tree bark.

genetics-gene-combustible = Combustibility
genetics-gene-combustible-desc = Increases heat damage by 50%. Taking at least 12 heat damage at once adds fire stacks.
genetics-feeling-combustible = Intense heat makes your skin tingle alarmingly.

genetics-gene-toxin-recovery = Toxin recovery
genetics-gene-toxin-recovery-desc = While alive and below 20 total damage, recovers 0.2 poison damage per second in addition to ordinary minor regeneration.
genetics-feeling-toxin-recovery = Your body starts clearing toxins faster.

genetics-gene-quiet-step = Quiet step
genetics-gene-quiet-step-desc = Your footsteps are silent while barefoot.
genetics-feeling-quiet-step = The soles of your feet feel softer.

genetics-gene-delicate-tissues = Delicate tissues
genetics-gene-delicate-tissues-desc = Increases blunt and slash damage by 10%.
genetics-feeling-delicate-tissues = Your skin becomes more delicate and sensitive to blows.

genetics-gene-fur = Insulating fur
genetics-gene-fur-desc = Reduces body cooling by 90%. Does not change organs or appearance.
genetics-feeling-fur = Your body starts retaining heat better.

genetics-gene-heat-sensitivity = Heat sensitivity
genetics-gene-heat-sensitivity-desc = Lowers the overheating threshold by 5 K, doubles temperature heat damage and increases other heat damage by 10%.
genetics-feeling-heat-sensitivity = Heat becomes noticeably harder to bear.

genetics-gene-predatory-bite = Predatory bite
genetics-gene-predatory-bite-desc = Replaces ordinary unarmed damage with 7 piercing damage.
genetics-feeling-predatory-bite = Your jaws tense with newfound strength.

genetics-gene-thirst = Increased thirst
genetics-gene-thirst-desc = Increases water consumption by approximately 2.67 times.
genetics-feeling-thirst = You feel an increasing thirst.

genetics-gene-chitin-armor = Chitinous armor
genetics-gene-chitin-armor-desc = Reduces blunt, slash and piercing damage by 10%.
genetics-feeling-chitin-armor = A dense protective layer forms beneath your skin.

genetics-gene-radiotrophic = Radiotrophic metabolism
genetics-gene-radiotrophic-desc = Reduces radiation damage by 80%. Gradually absorbs radiation damage to produce chitzite, but requires one third more food.
genetics-feeling-radiotrophic = An unusual warmth stirs inside your body.

genetics-gene-arctic = Arctic adaptation
genetics-gene-arctic-desc = Lowers the cold damage threshold by 64.6 K, halves temperature cold damage and reduces other cold damage by 25%. Maintains mobility in colder conditions.
genetics-feeling-arctic = Freezing air feels more familiar.

genetics-gene-fragile-tissues = Fragile tissues
genetics-gene-fragile-tissues-desc = Increases blunt, slash and piercing damage by 15%.
genetics-feeling-fragile-tissues = Even light pressure on your body feels painful.

genetics-gene-cryostasis = Cryogenic tolerance
genetics-gene-cryostasis-desc = Protects against cold damage while still allowing the body to cool. Only extreme cold slows you down. Does not protect against low pressure.
genetics-feeling-cryostasis = Cold no longer causes you pain.

genetics-gene-hyperthermia = Excess heat production
genetics-gene-hyperthermia-desc = While alive, the body produces an additional 3900 W of heat, increasing the risk of overheating.
genetics-feeling-hyperthermia = An exhausting heat builds inside you.
